<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατᾰγώγ-ιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lodging, inn,
			resting-place</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				259a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μουσῶν κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἀσωτίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eum.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; <i>official residence</i> of a magistrate, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Arc.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν δαιμόνων κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				610.1
			</span></i> (Zorava, <span class="entity">vi A. D.</span>):—the form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατᾰγωγ-γεῖον</span></b>  is required by
			metre in <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				53.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Macho
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.337d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>extra payment for transport,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PEleph.
				14.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				35.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καταγώγια</span>
			<i>festival of the return</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγώγια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.395a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1109.114
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
